# Express

- `src/app.ts`: helmet, cors, `express.json()`, `requestLogger`, Swagger (dev), routers, **`errorHandler` last**. No `listen()`.
- `src/server.ts`: `app.listen(config.SUBSCRIPTION_SERVICE_PORT)`.
- Mounts are unversioned, e.g. `/subscriptions`.

## Authenticated route chain

```
authMiddleware → requireAccessToken → validate(schema) → asAuthenticatedHandler(controller.method)
```

Pull controllers from `container`. Use `validate()` from `libs/validation/src/validate.ts`.

## Controllers

Bind methods in the constructor. Empty lists → `response.NO_DATA_FOUND` (200). Creates → 201 `{ ...response.DATA_SAVED, data }`. Always `try/catch` → `next(error)`.

Copy `auth.middleware.ts` and `error-handler.ts` from User Service. Throw `AppError` subclasses from services only.
